+// Each participant loads its own immutable add-on image. ReShade ownership and
+// participant attachment are deliberately separate: this path never loads a
+// second ReShade, changes its configuration, or rewrites an installation.
+constexpr DWORD participant_attach_timeout_ms = 15000;
